      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Trichomycterus albinotatus Costa, 1992</li><li>Size: 46 mm (1.8 in) SL</li><li>IUCN Red List: Least Concern (last assessed 2018)</li><li>Type locality: Visconde de Maua, 1 kilometer west of Maromba, Rio Preto, Rio Paraiba basin, Rio de Janeiro State, Brazil, elevation above 1,100 meters.</li></ul>"
    },
