      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1231",
      "html": "<p>This genus takes live or frozen food is well accepted, as is commercial dry prepared foods. Be careful not to overfeed. In nature, they feed on small invertebrates living at the bottom.</p>"
